                                                "text": "1841, Zoé de Gatti de Gamond [authoress of French original; English translator unknown], The Phalanstery; or, Attractive Industry and Moral Harmony, introduction, page xxiii\nThis voice, this unity, is the true attractivity which is to redeem man."
